# Package F "Carmen": Carmen has the key to the stash (carmen_stash) that holds the Carmen's diary.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('carmen_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: You came to hear me sing? Everybody comes to hear me sing.
#
o_text: Rourke knows. Give me the diary, and you get a trial instead of a bullet.
o_id: carmen_talk
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(carmen)') && !HasItem('carmen_stash_key')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: Yield
o_fail: Refuse
#
o_text: Rourke is paying me. You could pay more.
o_id: carmen_bribe
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(carmen)') && !HasItem('carmen_diary') && !HasFlag('carmen_paid')
o_goto: Bribe
#
o_text: Why do people think you were dead?
o_id: carmen_lore
o_goto: Lore
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: carmen_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Lore
npc: Because I wanted them to. A woman disappears, a man appears. A man disappears... The dome is small, darling. People are so easy to lose.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: carmen_lore_back
o_goto: Default

name: Yield
npc: (She laughs, softly, and gives you the key.) A trial. How old-fashioned. Fine. Let them read it. They'll understand.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'carmen_stash_key', 1)
effect: EndConversation

name: Refuse
npc: (Her smile does not reach her eyes.) Run along, darling.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribe
npc: (She counts out four hundred without looking.) Tell the old man the trail went cold. Come and hear me sing sometime.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 400)
effect: SetFlag('carmen_bribed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Sit in the front row, darling.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Sweet dreams.
effect: EndConversation
